  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:290px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-lightblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Usurp Worth</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/54/Asagi.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20140517110042\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Asagi\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/54/Asagi.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20140517110042\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/54/Asagi.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20140517110042 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/54/Asagi.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20140517110042 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Asagi\" width=\"200\" height=\"367\" data-image-key=\"Asagi.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Asagi.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Asagi (Disgaea series) can steal someone else's destiny.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Steal the powers of a chosen one.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"It's unfortunate you were promised a power that was never truly yours. But take comfort in knowing that I will use it in ways you could never have imagined.\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Cinder Fall to Pyrrha Nikos (RWBY)</dd></dl></div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"Scott McCall: You taught Kate, you helped her. All for power.<br />Peter Hale: For my family’s power. To be rightfully inherited by me. Not usurp, by some idiot teenage boy so incorruptible he wouldn’t shed the blood of his enemies even when justified.\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Peter Hale (<i>Teen Wolf</i>) failed attempt in trying to take back Scott McCall' alpha werewolf spark</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The power to <b>steal the powers of a chosen one for themselves</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Chosen_Oneness_Transferal\" title=\"Chosen Oneness Transferal\">Chosen Oneness Transferal</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a>. Opposite of <a href=\"/wiki/Destiny_Chosen\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Destiny Chosen\">Destiny Chosen</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Destiny_Unchosen\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Destiny Unchosen\">Destiny Unchosen</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUsurp_Worth%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Destiny Theft/Thievery/Absorption</li>\n<li>Fate Theft/Thievery/Absorption</li>\n<li>Fated One's Destiny Theft/Thievery/Absorption</li>\n<li>Destined One's Fate Theft/Thievery/Absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUsurp_Worth%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can throw a wrench in the works of destiny by taking the place of a so called chosen one for themselves. They can wield legendary weapons they <a href=\"/wiki/Worthiness_Enchantment\" title=\"Worthiness Enchantment\">shouldn't be able to</a>, steal the spotlight from the one expected to win or do the great feat everyone thought only <a href=\"/wiki/Destiny_Chosen\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Destiny Chosen\">one person</a> could do.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUsurp_Worth%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Destiny_Assignment\" title=\"Destiny Assignment\">Destiny Assignment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Destiny_Manipulation\" title=\"Destiny Manipulation\">Destiny Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Power_Absorption\" title=\"Divine Power Absorption\">Divine Power Absorption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Borrowing\" title=\"Power Borrowing\">Power Borrowing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Powerful_Objects\" title=\"Powerful Objects\">Powerful Objects</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Powers_Via_Object\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Powers Via Object\">Powers Via Object</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Title_Bestowal\" title=\"Title Bestowal\">Title Bestowal</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUsurp_Worth%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Authority_Manipulation\" title=\"Authority Manipulation\">Authority Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Chosen_Oneness_Transferal\" title=\"Chosen Oneness Transferal\">Chosen Oneness Transferal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Existence_Theft\" title=\"Existence Theft\">Existence Theft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fate_Denial\" title=\"Fate Denial\">Fate Denial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Supersede\" title=\"Supersede\">Supersede</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Total_Mimicry\" title=\"Total Mimicry\">Total Mimicry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Worthiness_Bypassing\" title=\"Worthiness Bypassing\">Worthiness Bypassing</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUsurp_Worth%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Chosen ones with <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Immunity\">Power Immunity</a>.</li>\n<li>Users of <a href=\"/wiki/Meta_Luck\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Meta Luck\">Meta Luck</a> cannot be affected.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUsurp_Worth%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>See Also: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/HijackedDestiny\">Hijacked Destiny</a>.</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Elk/Elc Kowalapule (<i>Arc The Lad</i>)</li>\n<li>Ancient Shamans <i>(Talisman Emperor)</i></li>\n<li>The Bard (<i>The Bards Tale 2004</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://disgaea.fandom.com/wiki/Asagi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:disgaea:Asagi\">Asagi</a> (<i>Disgaea series</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://disgaea.fandom.com/wiki/Mao\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:disgaea:Mao\">Mao</a> (<i>Disgaea 3</i>)</li>\n<li>The Principal (<i>Every Witch Way</i>)</li>\n<li>New York Knights (<i>King Arthur and the Knights of Justice</i>)</li>\n<li>Iris (<i>Konosuba</i>)</li>\n<li>Tact (<i>Rising of the Shield Hero</i>); temporarily</li>\n<li>Cinder Fall (<i>RWBY</i>)</li>\n<li>Mantis (<i>Skunk-Fu</i>)</li>\n<li>Juni Cortez (<i>Spy Kids 3-D: Game Over</i>)</li>\n<li>Miles Morales/Spider-Man (<i>Spider-Verse Trilogy</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUsurp_Worth%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"2be773d41fcd41a63b4c07c93bbb283f\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:106px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Cinder_Fall_the_current_Fall_Maiden-gif\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Cinder_Fall_the_current_Fall_Maiden.gif\" title=\"Cinder Fall the current Fall Maiden.gif (843 KB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185